    colors: 3 colors -- fill color C (most frequent) = matching wall color, center color (4 pixels, more central), indicator color 2/red (2 pixels, more peripheral)
    direction: sign(centroid(indicator) - centroid(center)) gives slide direction
    each legend's fill color C is unique and matches exactly one wall color
  walls:
